title: The Chancellorship
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/chancellor.jpg
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and chancellor_party = spd_name
subtitle: With the Chancellorship, we have a range of powers we can deploy to our advantage.

= The Chancellorship

- @direct_the_cabinet: We can direct the [+ spd_name +] ministers in our cabinet to pursue our policy goals.
- @coalition: We can improve relations with our coalition partners.
- @shuffle_cabinet: We can reshuffle the cabinet.
- @snap_election: We can call snap elections.
- @root: We do not want to take any action at present.
- @easy_discard

@direct_the_cabinet
view-if: direct_the_cabinet_timer >= 0
go-to: direct_the_cabinet

@coalition
view-if: not in_spd_majority
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5 if z_in_government; ddp_relation += 5 if ddp_in_government; dvp_relation += 5 if dvp_in_government; uspd_relation += 5 if uspd_in_government; sapd_relation += 5 if sapd_in_government

We have improved our relations with our coalition partners, and reduced tensions with the coalition.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
on-arrival: next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@shuffle_cabinet
on-arrival: shuffle_cabinet_timer = 6

Do we wish to shuffle our cabinet? This might upset our current coalition.

Current cabinet:

Labor: [+ labor_minister_party +]

Interior: [+ interior_minister_party +]

Finance: [+ finance_minister_party +]

Economic: [+ economic_minister_party +]

Justice: [+ justice_minister_party +]

Foreign: [+ foreign_minister_party +]

Reichswehr: [+ reichswehr_minister_party +]

Agriculture: [+ agriculture_minister_party +]

- @shuffle: Yes, do it.
- @extra_shuffle: Can we change our governing coalition entirely?
- @root: No, there is no need.
- @easy_discard

@shuffle
on-arrival: coalition_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1
go-to: election_1928.ministries

@extra_shuffle
on-arrival: leverage = spd_r; z_relation -= 5 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front; dvp_relation -= 5 if in_grand_coalition; uspd_relation -= 5 if in_popular_front or in_left_front; labor_minister_party = "I"; interior_minister_party = "I"; finance_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = "I"; justice_minister_party = "I"; foreign_minister_party = "I"; agriculture_minister_party = "I"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I";
go-to: election_1928.coalition_menu

#todo: changing coalitions should anger current coalition partners...

